   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reintegration Assistance from Belgium 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Reintegration Assistance project is to facilitate the sustainable reintegration of eligible migrants returning from Belgium through the Assisted Voluntary Return (AVR) project through reliable, efficient, rights- and needs-based assistance and with a specific support to migrants in a situation of vulnerability.</narrative>
